{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "In-house IMS Application Server（文档暂用名）运维大盘。看板只呈现本仓库真实导出的指标与集群自带指标，**不含任何容量数字、不含时延面板、不含 Diameter Sh 面板**。⚠️ 前置条件：chart 的 Pod 模板没有 prometheus.io/scrape 注解、chart 内没有 ServiceMonitor/PodMonitor，抓取接线未闭环，补齐前所有 as_* 面板无数据。详见同目录 README.md。",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "状态存储可达性（当前值）",
      "description": "指标 as_state_store_available{use_case}，语义：1 = Redis 可达（PING 成功），0 = 不可达。生产路径有条件写入：仅当 REDIS_URL 非空时才探测；未设置时该序列**不存在（不是 0）**，本面板会显示 No data 而不是 0。数据源前提：抓取接线未闭环（见 README.md §2）。这是可达性状态条件，**不是容量指标**，不隐含任何吞吐或并发结论（O1 未裁决）。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min by (use_case) (as_state_store_available)",
          "legendFormat": "{{use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "不可达" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "可达" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pod Ready 状态（当前值）",
      "description": "指标 kube_pod_status_ready{condition=\"true\"}，来自集群提供的 kube-state-metrics，本仓库不产生该指标。0 = 该 Pod 的 Ready 条件为 false。AS 进程 draining 时 /health/ready 返回 503（ADR-0009），所以持续 0 通常是排空未完成或 Pod 未就绪。命名空间级查询、不按 label_* 收窄，与 deploy/alerts/as-alerts.yaml 的选择器纪律一致（kube-state-metrics 只有配置了标签白名单才会暴露 label_* 系列）。⚠️ 集群未安装 kube-state-metrics 时本面板无数据。这是就绪状态，**不是容量指标**。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max by (pod) (kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=~\"$AS_NAMESPACE\", condition=\"true\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "NotReady" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "Ready" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Deployment 副本：期望 / 可用（当前值）",
      "description": "指标 kube_deployment_spec_replicas 与 kube_deployment_status_replicas_available，均来自集群提供的 kube-state-metrics。两者只反映 Kubernetes 已公布的整数状态，**不说明系统「应该」有几个副本** —— 副本数下限属于 O1 容量目标，M6 实测裁决后才允许填写（deploy/helm/values.yaml autoscaling 段全部留空）。命名空间级查询，会覆盖同命名空间的 state-redis / config-service 等 Deployment，用 deployment 标签区分。⚠️ 集群未安装 kube-state-metrics 时无数据。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max by (deployment) (kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=~\"$AS_NAMESPACE\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{deployment}} 期望",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max by (deployment) (kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=~\"$AS_NAMESPACE\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{deployment}} 可用",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "各用例在途呼叫数（按 use_case 汇总）",
      "description": "指标 as_active_calls{use_case,pod}（gauge），语义：某实例当前承载的在途呼叫数。生产路径由 __main__.py 的 metrics loop 每 15s 无条件写入，不依赖 OTLP。⚠️ 抓取接线未闭环前本面板无数据（chart 无 scrape 注解、无 ServiceMonitor/PodMonitor）。AS_M5_SIMULATED_ACTIVE_CALLS 只是 M5 证据开关，不是生产负载。本面板是**当前数量的观测，不是容量上限**：不存在任何「应该小于多少」的阈值，O1 未裁决（AGENT.md §2）。告警侧只有相对变化规则 ASActiveCallsSurge。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (use_case) (as_active_calls)",
          "legendFormat": "{{use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" }
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "每 Pod 在途呼叫数（按 pod + use_case）",
      "description": "指标 as_active_calls{use_case,pod}（gauge），不聚合。缩容守卫（ADR-0010）需要的是**每实例**数值：聚合均值可以很低而单个实例仍在承载呼叫，所以本面板刻意保留 pod 维度。与面板 4 对照看即可判断负载是否集中。⚠️ 抓取接线未闭环前无数据。数量观测，非容量指标：不得据此推导「一个 Pod 能扛多少呼叫」。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "as_active_calls",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} / {{use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" }
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "缩容守卫状态 as_downscale_removable（1=可摘除 / 0=受保护或 draining）",
      "description": "指标 as_downscale_removable{use_case,pod}（gauge），语义：1 = 守卫允许摘除该实例；0 = 仍在承载呼叫**或**已在 draining。生产路径每 15s 无条件写入。⚠️ 抓取接线未闭环前无数据。二值状态条件，**不是容量指标**：本面板不设阈值，因为「呼叫数大于多少才保护」属于 O1 未裁决项；当前实现的口径是「大于 0 即保护」（deploy/helm/values.yaml downscaleGuard.protectWhenActiveCallsAbove）。持续 0 且 as_active_calls 也为 0 → draining 未收敛，见告警 ASDownscaleBlocked。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max by (pod, use_case) (as_downscale_removable)",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} / {{use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "orange", "index": 1, "text": "受保护 / draining" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "可摘除" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "steppedLine": true,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SIP 响应速率（按 use_case + status_class）",
      "description": "指标 as_sip_responses_total{use_case,status_class,status_code}（counter），速率由 rate() 计算。⚠️ 重要前置条件：生产路径**没有数据生产者** —— 唯一写入点是进程启动时的一次性探针 AS_M5_PROBE_SIP_STATUS（生产 on-prem 不设置），真实响应路径尚未在每个响应上接线（M7）。因此标准部署下本面板预期为 No data，不是「零流量」。本面板是**速率观测，不是吞吐能力承诺**：仓库没有任何 CPS/BHCA 口径，O1 未裁决。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (use_case, status_class) (rate(as_sip_responses_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{use_case}} / {{status_class}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" }
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "失败响应占比（5xx + 非 487 的 4xx）/ 全部响应",
      "description": "指标 as_sip_responses_total，比率口径与告警 ASHighErrorRatio 一致（分子：5xx + status_code!=\"487\" 的 4xx；分母：全部响应，用 clamp_min(…,1) 防除零）。这是**比率，不是容量指标**：它只说明响应的失败构成，不说明系统能扛多少呼叫，也不说明「应该是多少」——面板刻意不画 1% 阈值线，阈值只在 deploy/alerts/as-alerts.yaml 里唯一维护。487（主叫取消）按正常行为排除。⚠️ 与面板 7 相同：生产路径无数据生产者。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(sum(increase(as_sip_responses_total{status_class=\"5xx\"}[5m])) + sum(increase(as_sip_responses_total{status_class=\"4xx\", status_code!=\"487\"}[5m]))) / clamp_min(sum(increase(as_sip_responses_total[5m])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "失败占比",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "min": 0
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "规则命中速率（按 rule）—— 当前无生产者，预期无数据",
      "description": "指标 as_rule_hits_total{rule}（counter）。⚠️ **本面板预期为 No data**：CallMetrics.record_rule_hit 已定义，但 src/ 下没有任何调用方，该序列从不被写入。它保留在看板里是为了让「缺数据」的原因可查，而不是承诺会有数据。恢复条件：决策路径接上真实生产者。届时还需一个基于自身滚动基线的**相对**异常口径 —— 「命中必须低于 N」这种绝对阈值就是伪装成阈值的容量数字，本仓库禁止（AGENT.md §2）。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (rule) (rate(as_rule_hits_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rule}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" }
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "状态存储可达性历史（as_state_store_available）",
      "description": "指标 as_state_store_available{use_case}（gauge）随时间变化，1 = Redis 可达，0 = 不可达。这是面板 1 的历史视角。会话、Dialog、反诈速率窗口状态都在 Redis（ADR-0002 / ADR-0007），掉到 0 意味着在途呼叫无法维持、新判决失去计数器。⚠️ 前置条件有两个：抓取接线未闭环；REDIS_URL 未设置时序列不存在（不是 0）。可达性状态条件，**不是容量指标** —— Redis 不可达与并发或吞吐上限无关。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min by (use_case) (as_state_store_available)",
          "legendFormat": "{{use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "不可达" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "可达" }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "steppedLine": true,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "遥测丢弃速率（as_telemetry_dropped_total）—— 需配置 OTLP endpoint 才有数据",
      "description": "指标 as_telemetry_dropped_total{use_case}（counter），语义：有界队列丢弃的遥测事件数。两个前置条件都必须满足才有数据：① 抓取接线闭环；② OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT 非空（chart 默认 telemetry.otlpEndpoint: null，此时 sink 是 NoOp，队列不填）。即使配上 endpoint，exporter 当前默认仍是 NoOpExporter，队列难以填满。丢遥测是设计上可接受的（ADR-0005），对呼叫建链施加背压不可接受。速率是**丢弃速率观测，不是容量指标**。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 36 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (use_case) (rate(as_telemetry_dropped_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{use_case}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" }
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
